{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_poca_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_poca_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"昨天的明天","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_poca_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"6ff5f69e43b7de08c35707fa4826d731d7a802264023313f8e84f5a79a628cae","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"早露在為新來的病人送去慰問餐的時候，遇到了過去的傭人。傭人對早露的狀態非常不理解。面對她的困惑，早露選擇了用行動來解釋。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"古米，這裡沒有其他人，你老實告訴我，你覺得怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"這是……這麼嚴肅的事情嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，這對我來說很重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……那好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就直說了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我承受得住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……其實，還不壞啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"真的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，畢竟早露姐你是嚴格按照食譜來做的菜嘛，怎麼樣也不會難吃到哪裡去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，要我說的話，早露姐你有點太拘泥於食譜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，這樣有什麼問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"大部分廚師都不會真的完全按照食譜來的啦，你做得太小心了，雖然不難吃，但其實反而會讓菜變得……沒那麼好吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……原來如此，難怪我總覺得我做的菜沒有古米你做的好吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，古米畢竟在這方面經過了千錘百煉呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"早露姐你能做到這個地步已經很不錯啦，反正比凜冬姐好多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"在這方面贏過她我不會高興的啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"古米，早露，拜託你們的飯菜已經準備好了嗎？今天的病人們已經差不多就醫結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，角峰叔，已經準備好了！我和早露姐會把飯菜送過去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好，那就交給你們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，希望這些飯菜能讓他們打起精神。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_infirmary"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"大家好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，古米，今天是你替病人們做慰問餐嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"不只是我，還有早露姐哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"真的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"其實只是想找個藉口向古米學習廚藝而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"Medic姐姐，我跟你說哦，早露姐為了做好這幾道菜，花了許多功夫呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"古米我啊，作為師父，有這樣的徒弟可開心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，羅德島上又要多出一個大廚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我要學的還多著呢。我們先去送飯給病人們吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的女病人","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"聽你的口音，你不是維多利亞人吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"健談的女病人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，別提了，我為了治丈夫的病，陪著他從烏薩斯一路來到維多利亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"健談的女病人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結果，他的病好了，我倒是不知怎的，染上了這該死的礦石病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的女病人","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"那你丈夫……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"健談的女病人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他倒是沒有拋下我，四處打聽到了這裡，還把我送了過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的女病人","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"那你還算有福氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"健談的女病人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這有什麼啊，欸，你不知道，在他得病前，我在一位大人物家當女傭，那個時候啊，才叫有福氣！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"病人們都在這裡了，我來幫你們分發吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"健談的女病人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"健談的女病人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"娜塔莉婭小姐，您不是娜塔莉婭小姐嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你是……索菲婭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，是索菲婭，您過去的女傭，索菲婭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你……對了，我記得你在切城事件之前就離開了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，是的，為了治我那死鬼阿列克謝的病，我不得不辭去在您家的工作，用存的錢陪著他來了維多利亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在聽說了切爾諾伯格的事情後一直都很擔心您，您沒事真是太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，您為什麼會在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這裡一定是羅斯托夫家的產業！而您是這裡的主人，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"娜塔莉婭小姐，請您發發慈悲，可憐可憐您的索菲婭吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了阿列克謝，我東奔西走，沒想到自己反倒感染了這該死的礦石病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您發發慈悲，讓這裡的人多給我一些藥吧，我還想活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我不是這裡的主人，索菲婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，如果您不是的話，那麼為什麼您會在這裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"周圍的目光不斷聚集，早露意識到，這裡不是說話的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"早露姐，這裡就交給我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯，謝謝你，古米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我來吧，索菲婭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"請進。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，這裡是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是我的宿舍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宿舍？您怎麼可以住在這樣的地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在以前，連我們這些下人住的地方都比這裡要好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"現在我已經習慣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，您可是金枝玉葉，怎麼能習慣於這樣的馱獸棚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是老爺和夫人知道，不知道該有多難過！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"羅斯托夫家已經沒落了，索菲婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅斯托夫家……沒落了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動摧毀了切爾諾伯格，包括它擁有的財富，和生活在其中的人的尊嚴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道夫人和老爺都——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"在那之後，我有打聽過爸爸和媽媽的消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"他們並沒有死，他們比我幸運一些，逃出了切爾諾伯格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"他們以為我死了，於是去了其他城市，如今，應該已經在某座城市裡重新扎根了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，既然如此，為什麼您會留在這艘艦船上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡不是您應該待的地方！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您應該去找老爺和夫人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要他們還活著，羅斯托夫家族一定能夠東山再起的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我真的這麼打算，剛逃出來的時候我就該這麼做了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"索菲婭，我沒有那個打算，你所知道的娜塔莉婭已經死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"現在在這裡的，只是一個叫早露的羅德島幹員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，我知道了。您一定是和老爺夫人弄得不開心才跑了出來，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"請進。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接著。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，這是……我和真理之前在讀書會時提到的那本《德斯特羅兄弟》？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼凜冬你會拿著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安娜特地幫你找的，託我送過來給妳，她出任務去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，誰允許你以這樣的口吻和娜塔莉婭小姐說話的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"索菲婭，不要這麼說話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，小姐，相信我，太遷就這些對身份沒有認識的人，他們只會得寸進尺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，把東西交給主人的時候，要恭恭敬敬地用雙手遞過去，這樣丟過來是怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關你什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太粗魯了，太粗魯了！你的衣服，你是彼得海姆中學的學生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是又怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是小姐新的隨從嗎？怎麼這麼不懂規矩！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蛤？你再說一遍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，小姐，我還記得您說過，彼得海姆中學帶壞了切爾諾伯格學生的整體風貌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而現在，您都淪落到要讓那所學校的學生當您的隨從。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算您不願意返回烏薩斯，也應該找一個更加符合您身份的地方生活！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，她早就不是什麼大小姐了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，孩子，你以為自己和小姐生活在同一個地方，就可以和她平起平坐了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看你剛才送給小姐的那本書，還有這面書架上的這些書籍、劇集、樂譜——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使身處這樣的環境之中，小姐也依然保持了過去的品味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的覺得，自己和小姐處於同一層次嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，就算她是貴族，又有什麼可威風的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，我在好幾家貴族當過傭人，我知道什麼是真正的高貴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而娜塔莉婭小姐，正是我見過的，最符合“高貴”這個詞定義的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）別在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別忘了你今天還有事情要做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事情？小姐，您有什麼事情要辦的話，讓我幫您去辦吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不是什麼大事，附近有座村莊的老師受傷了，孩子們少了一個老師，我要去為他們代課。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？小姐，您怎麼可以屈尊去做這樣的事？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我去找這裡的負責人理論吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們怎麼能讓您去做這種事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不，索菲婭，我是自願的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的學生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"早露老師好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"巴尼，你父親的病好一點了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的學生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！我爸叫我好好感謝羅德島的醫生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你能好好上課，就是最好的感謝了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的學生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怯懦的學生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"早、早露老師，好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，特特，你終於願意來上課了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怯懦的學生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，媽媽說，讓我，給你這個，謝謝，你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"這是，藥草？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怯懦的學生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我昨天，採的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，小姐，我來拿著吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些髒兮兮的藥草，您拿著只會髒了您的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，娜塔莉婭小姐心地善良，但是，下次你應該拿一些更好的東西感謝小姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怯懦的學生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對、對不起……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不用道歉，特特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"索菲婭，你在外面等我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，這裡太髒亂了，您要在這種地方教書，我怎麼能放心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我讓你出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"早露環視四周，由倉庫改建而成的教室非常簡陋，而在裡面的十幾雙眼睛或好奇或驚訝地盯著她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，孩子們，讓你們見笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我們開始今天的課程吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，請翻開你們的課本到67頁——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_med"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，小姐究竟怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村長","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你這人到底怎麼回事，你還在這裡閒晃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是娜塔莉婭小姐的傭人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村長","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"娜塔莉婭？哦，是早露小姐吧，她說過自己的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村長","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒是第一次知道她有傭人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村長","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"不對啊，早露小姐要是真的是有傭人的貴族，幹嘛還要賺錢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼，賺錢？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村長","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我們村裡的文學老師打獵的時候受了不輕的傷，在羅德島上治療，早露小姐好像是聽說了這裡缺老師主動來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村長","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"一開始，我們也以為她是哪裡來的貴族想要找樂子，結果教了兩天後，發現她居然是認真的，還教得很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村長","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們當然也願意付錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村長","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"她說了，她是想要賺錢買什麼東西才來的，什麼來著，好像是叫鋼琴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村長","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"前些日子，聽她說買鋼琴的錢已經存夠了，但她還是總來代課。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村長","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"要是你真是她的傭人，她真是哪裡的貴族小姐，怎麼可能會上我們這裡來教書？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村長","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是認錯人了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"娜塔莉婭小姐是貨真價實的貴族！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她擁有羅斯托夫家族的血脈，她天生就高人一等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這些鄉下人，根本不知道小姐曾經過著怎樣的生活！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"夠了，索菲婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我在裡面都聽得到你的聲音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，小姐，您怎麼能，您怎麼能這樣糟蹋自己？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您可是羅斯托夫家的千金啊！您這是在糟蹋自己的高貴！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"索菲婭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我一而再，再而三地對你忍耐，但你實在是有些過分了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你拼了命地想要證明我的高貴，是因為我真的高貴，還是你想要證明，你也高人一等？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在羅斯托夫家的時候，我過著那樣的好日子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每天只要想著怎樣服侍好老爺夫人還有您，一天雖然忙碌，但是充實。晚上的時候，我還有時間去劇院！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是多麼美好的時光啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是離開了那個家之後，您知道我受了多少的苦嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了讓自己和阿列克謝活下去，我每天都累死累活，到最後，我獲得了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是這該死的礦石病！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我才奇怪，為什麼您不願意回到那樣的日子裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要您願意回到烏薩斯重新成為貴族，只要您願意讓我跟著您，我們都能過上好日子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……索菲婭，對不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，那些好日子，不是我應得的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"就好像你的遭遇，又怎麼可能是你應得的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我不怪你這樣去想，因為過去我也以為自己擁有的一切是理所當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——這是不對的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"這是需要被改變的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您為什麼把這一切說得那麼輕鬆？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果這一切不是我應得的，如果我不這麼去想，我又該怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道，小姐，我不知道，我會死的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"村長，抱歉，讓您看到了難堪的一幕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村長","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼，唉，她也是個可憐人吶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以拿今天的報酬嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村長","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，當然，我已經準備好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"早露接過村長遞過來的袋子，將裡面的錢幣倒入自己的錢包中。\n錢包鼓鼓囊囊，看來已經累積了不少財富。\n早露猶豫片刻，走向索菲婭，將錢包塞入她的手中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"索菲婭，拿上這個，然後回去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我儲蓄的一部分，它應該足夠支付你這一療程的醫藥費。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我作為你曾經的主人唯一能為你做到的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"從此以後，你就別再叫我小姐了，即使有一天我會返回烏薩斯，那也不是以羅斯托夫家的女兒的身份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我在羅德島上有自己的代號，我叫——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"早露。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你也應該用這個代號稱呼我，我只是這裡的幹員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還是不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您為什麼要選擇這樣的生活？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……總有一天，你會明白的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我會去打聽老爺和夫人在哪，讓阿列克謝去告訴他們您還活著這件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你想怎麼做都可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，到時候做出選擇的，會是我自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前女傭索菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣好嗎？那筆錢你是要用的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你們怎麼來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我把事情和她們說了，安娜擔心你，就拉著我一起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……錢沒了，可以再賺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，有些事，總歸是要做個了結。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，裝什麼大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"沒辦法呀，我說過的，我只會這樣做。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"是我，怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，大小姐，有你的貨物到了，大傢伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"難道說——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對，就是你的鋼琴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你趕快回來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"凜冬，真理，我們快點回去吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"急什麼，東西又不會跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我等不及了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，這傢伙，哪裡還有大小姐的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"所以她才越來越被其他人接受了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼連你也幫她說話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在陳述事實而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"索尼婭你不也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我才沒接受她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，算了，那個鋼琴好像蠻貴的，她自己搬，萬一磕到琴了，還得花錢修。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也回去幫忙吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"放這裡就好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"你早就為鋼琴空出地方了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，畢竟這可是我來到羅德島以來最大的一筆開銷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我每天都念著它呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真不懂欸，那個女傭知道你用賺的錢買鋼琴為什麼會這麼難過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"因為如果我承認了我並不高貴，那麼，她將失去可以依靠的對象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就靠自己活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"接受這一點是很難的，你看，我花了那麼長的時間才理解了這一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我不怪她。是烏薩斯……不，是貴族，是那一套權力的體系把她變成這樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望未來有一天，每一個人都能像你一樣說出這句話，凜冬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"“那就靠自己活下去。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你都做到了，憑什麼其他人做不到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他們沒辦法，我就去幫他們想辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……是啊，那就幫他們想辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是為了這個，我想，我找到了一點返回烏薩斯的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"搞不懂你，總是在講些理所當然的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我很羨慕你啊，你總是能夠知道什麼事是理所當然的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……不過，剛才那句話我可不能當沒聽到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我告訴你我要賺錢買鋼琴的時候，你其實覺得我做不到吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我可沒這麼說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，你就是覺得我嬌生慣養，一定堅持不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得還好啊，要是大小姐你當了幹員以後就變得跟我一樣上躥下跳，我才覺得奇怪咧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"大小姐就是大小姐嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，不管怎麼說，你是用自己的勞動換來這架鋼琴的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都希望你能做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"對啊對啊，是吧，凜冬姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看我幹嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"我們重要的團員之一剛剛實現了心願，你是團長，當然該你來祝福一下啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，好啦，恭喜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，親愛的烏薩斯學生自治團的團員們，現在，你們將成為這台鋼琴的第一批聽眾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"好欸，我早就想聽早露姐彈鋼琴了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我也很期待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，你們這麼說我會不好意思的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我已經有很久沒有彈過鋼琴了，要是彈得不好聽，你們不可以笑我喔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"不會的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"反正我聽不出什麼區別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"avg_115_headbr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要彈就快點彈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，沒問你們兩個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"早露走到鋼琴邊，按下一個琴鍵，一瞬間，她感覺自己變回了“娜塔莉婭”。\n坐在華麗的房間中央，被名流們注視著進行演奏，她無需為任何事情煩惱，只需要去享受那優雅而又無知的時光。\n只不過，和自己曾經擁有——不，自己從未真正擁有過的名貴鋼琴相比，這台鋼琴的音色實在算不上好。\n粗糙的音色將她拉回了現實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，親愛的朋友們，今天我要為你們演奏的曲目是——《致勞倫斯》。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"聽眾只有四個人，房間也很簡樸，她要煩惱的事情有很多。\n琴聲響起，有些磕磕絆絆。\n但是，這樣就好。\n這是她選擇的，她很喜歡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["Medic"]},{"speakerId":"char_194_rosali","aliases":["烈夏"]},{"speakerId":"char_195_glassb","aliases":["真理"]},{"speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","aliases":["古米"]},{"speakerId":"char_197_poca","aliases":["早露"]}]}
